# Local-only artefacts that must never be published.
# Raw itch.io downloads and third-party pages stay outside this repo; the tools here regenerate them.
raw/
requests.log
# Throw-away browser profiles created by the headless test runners (history, cookies, caches)
**/tests/prof/
**/chrome-prof*/
**/chrome-profile/
# Python / Node build caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
# Secrets, just in case
.env*
*.pem
*.key

# The web's local store, used without Upstash (configs and edit-key hashes)
web/.data/

# Local working notes and machine-specific settings
HANDOFF.md
.claude/settings.local.json

# Fuente de la guía "CSS para itch.io": se edita aquí y build-web.mjs la copia a web/content/guia y web/public/guia
/guia/

# Notas locales: ajustes de Obsidian y plantillas/ADRs de trabajo
.obsidian/
docs/

# The web's build output (Vercel builds it from source)
web/dist/
web/dist-ssr/
web/build/
web/.react-router/
